
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nova - Modern Workspace</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #202333;
  background: #f8f9fc;
}
nav {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 22px 9%;
  background: white;
}
.logo { font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; color: #6554e8; }
nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #555; margin-left: 25px; }
button {
  background: #6554e8;
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 7px;
  padding: 12px 22px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.hero {
  padding: 90px 10%;
  text-align: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#eeedff,#f8f9fc);
}
.hero h1 { font-size: 48px; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 20px; }
.hero p { color: #666; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
.container { max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; padding: 65px 25px; }
.heading { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 35px; }
.heading p { color: #777; margin-top: 10px; }
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
  gap: 22px;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid #eee;
}
.card h3 { margin: 15px 0 10px; }
.card p { color: #777; line-height: 1.6; }
.icon { font-size: 32px; }
.about {
  background: #24243b;
  color: white;
  padding: 65px 10%;
  text-align: center;
}
.about p { color: #ccc; max-width: 650px; margin: 18px auto; line-height: 1.7; }
.testimonial {
  background: white;
  padding: 35px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: auto;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.pricing {
  text-align: center;
  background: white;
  padding: 40px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  max-width: 350px;
  margin: auto;
  border: 1px solid #eee;
}
.price { font-size: 38px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px; }
footer {
  background: #20243a;
  color: white;
  padding: 35px;
  text-align: center;
}
@media(max-width:700px) {
  .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 34px; }
  nav { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; }
  nav a { margin-left: 8px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">✦ NOVA</div>
  <div>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#features">Features</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
    <button onclick="alert('Welcome to Nova!')">Get Started</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <h1>Work smarter. Create something amazing.</h1>
  <p>A simple workspace designed to help teams collaborate, create and grow.</p>
  <button onclick="alert('Getting started!')">Explore Platform →</button>
</section>

<section class="container" id="features">
  <div class="heading">
    <h2>Everything you need</h2>
    <p>Powerful tools to make your everyday work easier.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>Fast Performance</h3>
      <p>Enjoy a smooth experience with tools designed for speed and productivity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🔒</div>
      <h3>Secure Workspace</h3>
      <p>Your projects and data stay protected with modern security features.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🌎</div>
      <h3>Work Together</h3>
      <p>Collaborate with your team from anywhere in the world.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <h2>Built for modern teams</h2>
  <p>Nova brings your projects, conversations and ideas together in one beautiful workspace. Spend less time managing work and more time creating great things.</p>
  <button onclick="alert('Learn more clicked!')">Learn More</button>
</section>

<section class="container">
  <div class="heading">
    <h2>What people say</h2>
    <p>Trusted by teams who love getting things done.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="testimonial">
    <p>"Nova has completely changed how our team works. Everything feels simpler, faster and more organized."</p>
    <br>
    <strong>Alex Morgan</strong>
    <p>Product Manager</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container" id="pricing">
  <div class="heading">
    <h2>Simple Pricing</h2>
    <p>Start building better workflows today.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pricing">
    <h3>Professional</h3>
    <div class="price">$19<span style="font-size:15px"> / month</span></div>
    <p>Unlimited projects</p><br>
    <p>Team collaboration</p><br>
    <p>Priority support</p><br>
    <button onclick="alert('Plan selected!')">Choose Plan</button>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <h2>✦ NOVA</h2>
  <p style="margin:12px">Making work feel effortless.</p>
  <p>© 2026 Nova Workspace. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>
<script async src="https://js.storylane.io/js/staging/repx.js" data-id="simcqfoc5ehu"></script>

</body>
</html>
